[43.397796, "o", "\r                                        \r\r\nI have started a set of research tasks to gather information about `ntfy` and figure out the best way to charm it. \r\n\r\nI'll review the official documentation (like the installation steps and configuration options I've already pulled up), check if any existing charms for `ntfy` exist on Charmhub, and synthesise a design proposal for you. \r\n\r\nOnce the research phase is complete, I'll present a design proposal for how we can build this charm and ask for your approval before we proceed to the build phase.\r\n\r\n"]
