[381.281922, "o", "\r                                        \r\r\nIt looks like your messages are coming through in chunks! \r\n\r\nYou mentioned: *\"When you call plan_tasks, \"* — feel free to finish your thought!\r\n\r\nJust to keep you updated: I actually ran ahead and completed the full research path you described. I cloned version `2.19.2` from the upstream source, read through the `server.yml` configuration and documentation, swept Charmhub (no existing charms found), and synthesised everything into the design proposal I shared in my previous message.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you have specific instructions for the task planning, or if you're ready to review the design and let me know whether we should include the S3 integration for attachments!\r\n\r\n"]
